SearchService ..> DocumentSummary

ProjectService ..> Project
ProjectService ..> ClassifierMetadata
ProjectService ..> Topic
ProjectService ..> DocumentProxy
ProjectService ..> ProxyLabel
ProjectService ..> PendingPipeline
ProjectService ..> LabellingResult

ClassificationService ..> Topic
ClassificationService ..> SearchQuery

VisualisationService ..> VisualisationQuery
VisualisationService ..> Dashboard
VisualisationService ..> TopicTimeSeries
VisualisationService ..> TimePoint
VisualisationService ..> TopicLanguageBreakdown
VisualisationService ..> LanguageCount
VisualisationService ..> TopicPlatformBreakdown
VisualisationService ..> PlatformCount
VisualisationService ..> TopicEntities
VisualisationService ..> EntityScore
VisualisationService ..> DocumentPreview

' ---- repositories -> mongo + schemas ----
UserRepository ..> User
DocumentRepository ..> SearchQuery
ProjectRepository ..> Project
ProjectRepository ..> ClassifierMetadata
ProjectRepository ..> DocumentProxy
ProjectRepository ..> PendingPipeline
TopicRepository ..> Topic
UserRepository ..> MongoDB
DocumentRepository ..> MongoDB
ProjectRepository ..> MongoDB
TopicRepository ..> MongoDB

